  "worked_solution": "If we trace along the letters of the angle name, from $A$ to $I$ to $F,$ we see that $∠AIF$ refers to the angle $∠7.$\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14131632/assets/8faa441bb1e209bd9a0910bf4d5fceadb6678b59653c280f9788f1fd0eb9b7a7.png)\n\nTherefore, $∠7$ is another name for $∠AIF.$",
